Real-World Applications
​AI Applications:
​GPS Navigation (e.g., Google Maps): Predicts traffic patterns and calculates the fastest real-time routes.
​Virtual Assistants (e.g., Siri, Alexa): Interprets natural language commands to set reminders or play music.
​ML Applications:
​Email Spam Filters: Analyzes incoming emails to automatically classify and filter out spam based on historical data patterns.
​Recommendation Engines (e.g., Netflix, Spotify): Predicts user preferences to recommend movies or music based on past viewing/listening habits.
​DL Applications:
​Facial Recognition: Used in smartphones and security systems to identify faces from high-resolution images or video feeds.
​Real-Time Language Translation: Neural machine translation tools that convert speech or text dynamically across multiple languages with high contextual accuracy.
